{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00225",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 6.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Alright, hello, please sit down. Is this your first time with this clinic?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.56,
      "end_seconds": 12.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Mm, you know, first time with this one, yes. A friend recommended it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.58,
      "end_seconds": 16.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "What made you decide to come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.09,
      "end_seconds": 29.91,
      "duration_seconds": 12.82,
      "text": "I'm here because of numbness on the left side of my face. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.4,
      "end_seconds": 33.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Right, when did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.66,
      "end_seconds": 40.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "I've had it for five days. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.49,
      "end_seconds": 45.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.12,
      "end_seconds": 49.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off. I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.28,
      "end_seconds": 53.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.85,
      "end_seconds": 59.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Uh, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.22,
      "end_seconds": 61.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Any trouble swallowing or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.64,
      "end_seconds": 66.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "No trouble swallowing or palpitations, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.01,
      "end_seconds": 69.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.28,
      "end_seconds": 75.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.89,
      "end_seconds": 83.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.75,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.31,
      "end_seconds": 98.95,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.97,
      "end_seconds": 109.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "Go on. Right, so that's your known an irregular heartbeat. We'll keep that in mind today. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.81,
      "end_seconds": 112.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.62,
      "end_seconds": 116.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.29,
      "end_seconds": 120.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.84,
      "end_seconds": 124.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.19,
      "end_seconds": 134.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 135.62,
      "end_seconds": 144.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Saturation 97 percent, temp 36.6 degrees. Pulse is 83 beats a minute, blood pressure 162 over 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.84,
      "end_seconds": 158.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.15,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.48,
      "end_seconds": 163.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Well, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.13,
      "end_seconds": 168.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.48,
      "end_seconds": 170.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.46,
      "end_seconds": 174.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.6,
      "end_seconds": 191.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "There's mild drooping at the left corner of your mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.82,
      "end_seconds": 194.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.05,
      "end_seconds": 216.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Grip strength is a little weaker on the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.41,
      "end_seconds": 218.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.78,
      "end_seconds": 232.93,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.47,
      "end_seconds": 248.11,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "Okay, so for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.05,
      "end_seconds": 256.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: My working impression is a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.77,
      "end_seconds": 260.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.48,
      "end_seconds": 280.55,
      "duration_seconds": 19.07,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible mini-stroke, which we need to investigate urgently do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had numbness on the left side of your face for five days, severe, and no trouble swallowing or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.96,
      "end_seconds": 283.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Yes, uh, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.39,
      "end_seconds": 300.48,
      "duration_seconds": 16.09,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a carotid scan for possible stroke. Don't drive for now, and bring someone with you to the next visit. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. We'll refer you to the stroke clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.53,
      "end_seconds": 304.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Well, um, sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.96,
      "end_seconds": 315.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "If the numbness, weakness or speech problem returns, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.33,
      "end_seconds": 320.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Uh, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.1,
      "end_seconds": 326.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.18,
      "end_seconds": 333.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.12,
      "end_seconds": 336.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Look after yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.07,
      "end_seconds": 340.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Okay, so nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}